  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Compact Waveshare development board based on Raspberry Pi RP2040, with USB Type-C, castellated PCB edges, an RGB LED, 264KB SRAM, and 2MB board Flash.\n\nThe official CAD ZIP contains RP2040_Zero.stp. A board revision and pre-soldered-header compatibility are not specified, so this is a mechanical reference without an inferred current storefront SKU or sales offer. RP2040 is the chip designer/family; Waveshare manufactures this board."
    }
  ],
